# Undead Sprinter: "You may cast this card from your graveyard if a non-Zombie creature died this turn. If you do, this creature
# enters with a +1/+1 counter on it." (CR 601.2, 122.1, 700.4) Turn 1 Bot1 casts the 2/2 Sprinter from its hand and an Ornithopter;
# Bot2 Bolts the Sprinter on turn 2. On turn 3 nothing has died yet, so the Sprinter cannot be cast from the graveyard even with
# the mana. Bot1 Bolts its own Ornithopter, which is not a Zombie, and may then cast the Sprinter from the graveyard; it enters
# with a +1/+1 counter and is a 3/3.

